<overview>
The Bo Tat was designed in the Outworlds Alliance to provide planetary airlift for Tariq mounted infantry. Standard airlift options generally proved to be preferable to the limited range and protection of the Bo Tat, so wide production was not adopted in the Outworlds Alliance. However, the Branth Irregulars in the Free Worlds League purchased several of these VTOL to allow them to deploy fresh Branth from midair into battle.
</overview>

